How we can do helm upgrade to latest version of Ingress NGINX?

1.Before upgrading, we must fetch the latest chart metadata from our repository provider. 
----->helm repo update ingress-nginx
2.To upgrade the release to the latest version, we can execute helm upgrade followed by our release name and the repository path
----->helm upgrade <RELEASE_NAME> ingress-nginx/ingress-nginx
? what is  RELEASE_NAME
--->If our Application is named my-app, the Helm release will also be named my-app.
### The release name is the handle we use to track, manage, upgrade, or uninstall that specific deployment
3.If the latest version causes issues or application downtime, immediately revert to our last stable revision
----->helm rollback <release-name> <revision-number> --namespace <namespace>

